WEBVTT

01:35.910 --> 01:40.830
[Fated Hearts]

01:41.580 --> 01:43.970
[Episode 26]

01:48.479 --> 01:50.210
What do you want, Your Majesty?

01:51.759 --> 01:52.490
Does it hurt?

01:54.400 --> 01:56.000
Please show some restraint.

01:57.229 --> 01:58.280
You've said that to me

01:58.280 --> 01:59.539
so many times already.

02:07.200 --> 02:08.419
Let go of me!

02:08.630 --> 02:09.289
Don't move!

02:11.120 --> 02:12.220
Move again,

02:12.870 --> 02:14.200
and I'll use this needle

02:14.400 --> 02:15.560
to maim your hand.

02:47.030 --> 02:49.030
Judging from how flustered you are,

02:49.190 --> 02:50.400
Xia Jingshi has never taken care of you

02:50.400 --> 02:51.800
like this before, has he?

02:53.079 --> 02:54.579
That's between him and me.

02:55.000 --> 02:56.530
It's none of your business.

02:58.240 --> 02:58.680
There.

02:59.280 --> 03:00.740
All the splinters are out.

03:04.280 --> 03:05.310
All you do is fool around

03:05.310 --> 03:06.510
with women and drink.

03:06.630 --> 03:09.160
Don't you have
any state affairs to attend to?

03:09.630 --> 03:10.560
Isn't the Emperor of Susha

03:10.560 --> 03:11.360
just the same?

03:12.150 --> 03:13.430
My father devotes himself

03:13.430 --> 03:14.430
to state affairs.

03:14.800 --> 03:16.600
He doesn't idle around like you.

03:17.400 --> 03:18.360
That's why he fell ill.

03:18.360 --> 03:19.680
He's been in a coma for days.

03:19.680 --> 03:21.410
I should take this as a warning.

03:23.670 --> 03:24.600
What did you say?

03:25.100 --> 03:26.630
What happened to my father?

03:26.750 --> 03:28.310
Didn't Xia Jingshi tell you?

03:28.310 --> 03:29.079
I sent someone

03:29.079 --> 03:30.340
to inform him early on.

03:30.600 --> 03:32.640
[Linfang Hall]

03:40.000 --> 03:40.870
My son

03:41.520 --> 03:42.920
is ignorant and immoral,

03:43.680 --> 03:45.000
used by traitors

03:46.120 --> 03:47.850
and led astray into rebellion.

03:50.680 --> 03:51.240
It was

03:51.520 --> 03:52.920
my failure as his father.

03:53.240 --> 03:55.040
I've come to offer my apologies.

03:56.800 --> 03:59.190
What do you want me to do?

04:03.630 --> 04:04.120
I

04:04.710 --> 04:07.560
dare not ask for Your Majesty's mercy.

04:08.070 --> 04:09.130
A father is to blame

04:09.430 --> 04:10.490
for a son's faults.

04:11.220 --> 04:12.490
I beg Your Majesty

04:12.630 --> 04:14.590
to take my life

04:15.600 --> 04:16.750
but spare

04:17.430 --> 04:18.920
my son's.

04:20.750 --> 04:21.700
You can

04:22.510 --> 04:24.240
break his limbs

04:25.360 --> 04:27.720
or even exile him,

04:29.190 --> 04:31.560
but please let him live.

04:32.630 --> 04:33.680
I…

04:34.240 --> 04:36.120
I have only

04:37.240 --> 04:41.360
this one son.

04:43.430 --> 04:45.390
I've never begged you
for anything in my life.

04:45.390 --> 04:47.920
You're one of the pillars of the court.

04:48.560 --> 04:52.630
You've devoted your life to Susha.

04:53.270 --> 04:55.470
Your body is covered with battle scars.

04:56.320 --> 04:57.750
Do you want me

04:58.630 --> 05:00.440
to add another wound

05:00.470 --> 05:02.830
to your scarred body?

05:05.040 --> 05:06.920
How could I bear to do that?

05:08.000 --> 05:08.600
Enough.

05:10.040 --> 05:11.160
Get up.

05:11.560 --> 05:12.360
Your Majesty.

05:16.160 --> 05:18.160
Do you want me to help you up?

05:18.870 --> 05:19.670
Your Majesty,

05:20.830 --> 05:22.120
I wouldn't dare.

05:23.360 --> 05:24.920
I am guilty.

05:25.510 --> 05:27.390
Please punish me.

05:27.920 --> 05:29.870
If you truly wished to die,

05:30.270 --> 05:32.190
you wouldn't have come to see me.

05:33.040 --> 05:34.390
You came bearing thorns,

05:34.390 --> 05:37.159
making sure everyone in the palace knew.

05:37.830 --> 05:39.030
You don't want to die.

05:40.090 --> 05:42.090
You want to live.

05:44.830 --> 05:46.630
We've known each other too long.

05:47.950 --> 05:49.480
Between old friends,

05:48.520 --> 05:52.170
[Changchun Palace]

05:49.830 --> 05:52.070
there's no need for such scheming.

05:53.510 --> 05:55.120
If I hadn't made you

05:55.430 --> 05:57.490
defend the borders these past years,

05:57.920 --> 05:59.270
your son

05:59.680 --> 06:02.410
wouldn't have gone so far astray

06:02.520 --> 06:03.850
for lack of discipline.

06:07.290 --> 06:08.910
By that logic,

06:09.600 --> 06:11.270
the blame lies with me.

06:12.000 --> 06:12.800
Your Majesty,

06:13.560 --> 06:14.490
I wouldn't dare.

06:15.040 --> 06:16.300
Please don't say that.

06:16.830 --> 06:19.680
I only beg you to spare my son.

06:20.270 --> 06:22.920
Please let him live!

06:26.800 --> 06:28.000
I am tired.

06:30.070 --> 06:31.510
You may go now.

06:32.950 --> 06:35.470
[Changchun Palace]

06:33.190 --> 06:34.159
Your Majesty.

06:34.920 --> 06:36.159
Your Majesty.

06:41.290 --> 06:45.350
[Changchun Palace]

06:57.750 --> 06:58.550
Your Majesty,

06:59.430 --> 07:00.760
your medicine is ready.

07:00.830 --> 07:01.560
Shall I

07:01.920 --> 07:03.290
bring it to you?

07:04.070 --> 07:05.480
Whether I drink it or not,

07:06.950 --> 07:09.070
I don't have much time left.

07:09.920 --> 07:10.720
Your Majesty.

07:12.800 --> 07:13.870
Why are you crying?

07:15.430 --> 07:16.630
If I had the strength,

07:17.420 --> 07:19.310
I'd kick you one more time.

07:21.190 --> 07:22.360
What a pity.

07:31.120 --> 07:31.580
Listen,

07:32.040 --> 07:34.070
stop that sniveling.

07:34.430 --> 07:35.000
Okay.

07:35.720 --> 07:36.190
Okay.

07:36.750 --> 07:38.190
My days are numbered.

07:40.080 --> 07:42.030
I'll let the First Prince

07:43.800 --> 07:45.730
do this favor to the Murong family.

07:46.920 --> 07:49.180
When the new emperor ascends the throne,

07:49.480 --> 07:51.040
he can grant amnesty to all

07:52.610 --> 07:54.370
to win the hearts of the people.

07:57.420 --> 07:58.480
I understand.

08:10.920 --> 08:12.520
What's wrong with my father?

08:12.560 --> 08:13.600
Xia Jingyan said he fell ill.

08:13.600 --> 08:15.200
He was lying to me, wasn't he?

08:17.870 --> 08:18.830
Say something!

08:19.470 --> 08:21.000
What happened to my father?

08:21.720 --> 08:23.320
Shortly after we left Susha,

08:24.190 --> 08:25.480
he fell gravely ill.

08:28.750 --> 08:29.880
That's impossible.

08:30.950 --> 08:32.679
How could he suddenly fall ill?

08:37.360 --> 08:38.419
You knew all along.

08:39.240 --> 08:40.500
Why didn't you tell me?

08:41.080 --> 08:43.360
Because telling you
wouldn't change anything.

08:43.360 --> 08:44.080
You can't help him.

08:44.080 --> 08:44.910
Xia Jingshi!

08:45.750 --> 08:46.320
How can you be

08:46.320 --> 08:47.580
so cold and heartless?

08:48.270 --> 08:49.620
That's my father.

08:49.790 --> 08:50.750
He's gravely ill.

08:50.750 --> 08:52.080
Don't I deserve to know?

08:52.390 --> 08:53.750
It's precisely because of this

08:53.750 --> 08:55.440
that you're better off not knowing.

08:55.440 --> 08:56.390
What could you have done?

08:56.390 --> 08:56.960
The truth is—

08:56.960 --> 08:58.670
you couldn't have done a thing.

08:58.670 --> 09:00.270
Not to mention
you're in a foreign land now;

09:00.270 --> 09:02.080
even if you were by his side,
what could you do?

09:02.080 --> 09:03.810
You couldn't change anything.

09:04.840 --> 09:05.630
He must have fallen ill

09:05.630 --> 09:06.440
because of me.

09:07.720 --> 09:08.650
I need to go back.

09:08.940 --> 09:09.320
Your Highness.

09:09.320 --> 09:10.580
I need to go back to him.

09:11.360 --> 09:12.220
Your Highness.

09:12.390 --> 09:12.750
She…

09:18.650 --> 09:19.680
[Rongyang Palace]

09:20.180 --> 09:20.970
Move aside!

09:23.660 --> 09:24.410
Move aside!

09:25.320 --> 09:26.450
Or I'll kill you all!

09:26.460 --> 09:27.320
Your Highness,

09:28.320 --> 09:29.600
no one may leave this place

09:29.600 --> 09:31.240
without His Majesty's permission.

09:31.240 --> 09:32.640
Please, try to calm down.

09:33.150 --> 09:34.200
Why should I?

09:34.710 --> 09:35.740
I am leaving!

09:35.760 --> 09:37.020
Move, or I'll kill you!

09:39.370 --> 09:40.100
How dare you!

09:40.670 --> 09:42.000
I am the Princess of Susha

09:42.000 --> 09:43.200
and the Princess of Zhennan!

09:43.200 --> 09:45.200
If you don't want to die, let go of me!

09:46.600 --> 09:47.630
Let go!

09:51.960 --> 09:53.150
Xia Jingyan indeed sent men

09:53.150 --> 09:54.150
to guard the gate.

09:55.940 --> 09:56.800
Your Highness,

09:56.960 --> 09:59.090
maybe you should talk to Her Highness.

10:16.200 --> 10:17.940
♪ Flying alone ♪

10:18.650 --> 10:21.260
♪ With no need for direction ♪

10:23.940 --> 10:26.160
♪ Flying up to the clouds ♪

10:24.390 --> 10:25.150
Let go!

10:26.040 --> 10:27.530
Let go of me!

10:26.390 --> 10:29.300
♪ Yet the sun is hiding ♪

10:28.030 --> 10:29.440
Who do you think you are

10:29.790 --> 10:31.070
to treat me like this?

10:31.510 --> 10:32.630
Let go of me!

10:31.540 --> 10:33.370
♪ Roaming freely ♪

10:33.630 --> 10:37.020
♪ Unafraid of wind or frost ♪

10:34.790 --> 10:36.060
Let me go!

10:36.150 --> 10:37.550
The Emperor anticipated

10:37.670 --> 10:38.320
that when you learned of

10:38.320 --> 10:39.630
your father's illness,

10:39.070 --> 10:40.900
♪ The wet wings ♪

10:39.630 --> 10:41.120
you'd be deeply distressed.

10:41.120 --> 10:42.390
He specifically sent me to check on you.

10:41.370 --> 10:44.000
♪ Will carry me far away ♪

10:42.390 --> 10:43.120
Get lost!

10:43.550 --> 10:44.870
Get lost, all of you!

10:45.630 --> 10:47.110
Take Her Highness to the side palace

10:47.110 --> 10:48.120
and keep a close eye on her.

10:48.120 --> 10:48.630
-Yes.
-Yes.

10:48.550 --> 10:52.100
♪ Don't cry, don't cry ♪

10:49.360 --> 10:50.510
Let go of me!

10:49.400 --> 10:53.420
[Rongyang Palace]

10:51.670 --> 10:52.750
Let go of me!

10:54.200 --> 10:55.440
Let go of me!

10:54.680 --> 10:58.970
♪ I'll find the way home ♪

10:58.670 --> 10:59.530
Your Highness,

10:59.630 --> 11:02.000
Zhuang Shen didn't
leave his manor all night.

11:02.000 --> 11:04.260
Our men have been keeping watch outside.

11:05.910 --> 11:07.550
He certainly keeps his composure.

11:07.550 --> 11:08.320
Your Highness,

11:08.320 --> 11:09.580
what should we do next?

11:09.790 --> 11:10.650
Gather our men.

11:11.440 --> 11:12.970
We're going to capture him.

11:30.670 --> 11:32.670
Feng Suige will definitely
send people to kill me

11:32.670 --> 11:34.210
once he returns to the capital.

11:34.210 --> 11:35.260
Uncle, you mean

11:35.360 --> 11:36.690
we should strike first—

11:36.960 --> 11:38.000
ambush him on his way

11:38.000 --> 11:39.400
to the Zhuang Residence.

11:39.440 --> 11:40.550
But where should we set the ambush?

11:40.550 --> 11:42.200
No matter where he starts from,

11:42.200 --> 11:43.360
to reach my residence,

11:43.360 --> 11:45.360
he'll have to pass Yongning Street.

11:50.960 --> 11:51.960
Yongning Street?

11:52.020 --> 11:53.480
That place is full of civilians.

11:53.480 --> 11:55.010
That's exactly what I want.

12:00.600 --> 12:01.840
Who are all these people?

12:01.840 --> 12:03.440
Isn't that the First Prince?

12:05.320 --> 12:06.120
Split your men—

12:06.120 --> 12:07.390
some visible, some hidden—

12:07.390 --> 12:08.390
so that Feng Suige

12:08.550 --> 12:09.950
will be caught off guard.

12:15.840 --> 12:16.300
My Lord,

12:17.080 --> 12:18.540
we've spotted Feng Suige.

12:18.790 --> 12:20.320
He's brought 20 to 30 men with him

12:20.320 --> 12:21.650
and is heading this way.

12:44.270 --> 12:45.530
Finally, you're here.

12:53.910 --> 12:55.360
Only by making a grand show

12:55.360 --> 12:56.890
of trying to kill Feng Suige

12:56.960 --> 12:59.320
and pretending
I'm in a desperate situation

12:59.320 --> 13:01.150
can I make him fall into my trap.

13:02.240 --> 13:03.440
I'll make him believe

13:04.480 --> 13:06.360
that I'm at the end of my rope.

13:09.000 --> 13:10.010
Then he will

13:10.120 --> 13:11.480
walk straight into

13:12.120 --> 13:14.360
the grave I've prepared for him.

13:15.440 --> 13:16.630
Rattle drum.

13:18.000 --> 13:19.120
Rattle drum!

13:53.690 --> 13:54.290
Watch out!

14:02.630 --> 14:03.240
Kill!

14:35.910 --> 14:37.240
Protect the civilians!

14:43.910 --> 14:44.720
Help!

14:50.600 --> 14:51.330
Are you okay?

14:51.550 --> 14:52.280
Are you okay?

15:16.480 --> 15:17.120
How are you?

15:17.120 --> 15:17.850
Don't worry.

15:17.910 --> 15:19.070
Just a small wound.

15:19.090 --> 15:19.720
I'm fine.

15:20.030 --> 15:20.980
Go.

15:21.120 --> 15:22.180
Help His Highness!

15:22.200 --> 15:22.630
Go!

15:22.630 --> 15:23.240
Hold on!

15:23.360 --> 15:23.870
Go!

15:25.480 --> 15:26.750
Everyone, be careful!

15:26.960 --> 15:29.290
There are assassins among the civilians!

15:48.270 --> 15:48.930
Be careful.

15:49.120 --> 15:49.630
You too.

15:53.440 --> 15:55.170
Don't blame me for being cruel.

15:55.440 --> 15:57.100
If all those people don't die,

15:57.720 --> 16:00.110
how could I drive Feng Suige mad

16:00.950 --> 16:02.580
and make him lose his mind?

16:05.910 --> 16:07.000
I'll bear

16:08.320 --> 16:10.670
all these sins alone.

16:09.220 --> 16:13.690
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Son,
Zhuang Jingheng]

16:11.670 --> 16:13.470
They have nothing to do with you.

16:45.080 --> 16:46.240
Ignore the others!

16:46.910 --> 16:48.270
Kill Feng Suige!

17:08.240 --> 17:09.480
Protect His Highness!

17:09.480 --> 17:10.310
Kill!

17:10.510 --> 17:14.480
Kill!

17:16.750 --> 17:17.609
Gather the men.

17:18.480 --> 17:20.000
We're going to capture him.

17:20.000 --> 17:20.440
Wait.

17:20.880 --> 17:21.589
Since the Feng Battalion

17:21.589 --> 17:23.030
is already outside the city,

17:23.030 --> 17:23.640
why not let them

17:23.640 --> 17:24.810
sneak into Yujing in advance?

17:24.810 --> 17:26.359
You're afraid
Zhuang Shen has a backup plan?

17:26.359 --> 17:27.960
We need to have our own backup plan.

17:27.960 --> 17:29.360
Never fight unprepared.

17:30.880 --> 17:32.000
Send word to Yun Fang.

17:32.000 --> 17:32.750
Tell him to take

17:32.750 --> 17:34.160
50 elite soldiers into Yujing in advance

17:34.160 --> 17:35.290
and stay on standby.

18:15.590 --> 18:16.920
Where is Zhuang Shen?

18:18.440 --> 18:19.130
Come on.

18:19.510 --> 18:20.030
Come on.

18:20.590 --> 18:21.480
Kill me.

18:22.350 --> 18:23.550
The Zhuang family

18:24.240 --> 18:26.470
will never be defeated!

18:32.200 --> 18:33.360
Everyone believes

18:33.400 --> 18:35.160
I'll kill Feng Suige

18:36.270 --> 18:38.070
with this method.

18:40.750 --> 18:41.960
But Feng Suige isn't

18:42.440 --> 18:43.930
someone so easy

18:44.030 --> 18:45.310
to take down.

19:01.160 --> 19:02.020
Your Highness,

19:02.110 --> 19:03.910
you go on ahead. Leave this to us.

19:13.750 --> 19:15.110
After I avenge you,

19:17.000 --> 19:18.640
I'll come join you.

19:26.550 --> 19:29.960
[Zhuang Residence]

19:32.070 --> 19:36.820
[Zhuang Residence]

20:58.110 --> 20:59.310
Where is Zhuang Shen?

20:59.510 --> 21:01.040
He's in the ancestral hall.

21:01.110 --> 21:02.370
In the ancestral hall.

21:03.280 --> 21:04.720
Zhuang Shen must be prepared.

21:04.720 --> 21:05.650
Be very careful.

21:05.880 --> 21:08.000
He's just struggling on his last breath.

21:08.000 --> 21:09.530
Today, I have to arrest him.

21:14.480 --> 21:15.590
Leave these men to me.

21:15.590 --> 21:16.850
You go get Zhuang Shen.

21:18.510 --> 21:19.310
Be careful.

23:16.830 --> 23:17.690
So you've come.

23:29.390 --> 23:30.630
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Son,
Zhuang Jingheng]

23:35.830 --> 23:36.960
I've waited so many years

23:36.960 --> 23:38.400
for this very day.

23:39.400 --> 23:40.930
Do you know how much I gave up

23:41.030 --> 23:42.160
to make this happen?

23:43.240 --> 23:44.200
My only regret

23:45.000 --> 23:46.070
is not letting your father

23:46.070 --> 23:47.800
watch you die with his own eyes.

23:48.440 --> 23:49.700
But it doesn't matter.

23:51.030 --> 23:53.490
I'll make sure you die in agony.

23:54.110 --> 23:55.100
Zhuang Shen,

23:55.680 --> 23:57.510
the one who will die today is you.

23:57.990 --> 24:00.360
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Son,
Zhuang Jingheng]

24:01.070 --> 24:01.680
Jingheng,

24:02.670 --> 24:04.910
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Son,
Zhuang Jingheng]

24:03.000 --> 24:04.070
what I promised you

24:04.070 --> 24:05.330
will be fulfilled now.

24:05.400 --> 24:06.860
I didn't go back on my word.

24:07.240 --> 24:08.700
I know you're watching.

24:10.440 --> 24:11.100
Feng Suige.

24:11.380 --> 24:13.670
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Son,
Zhuang Jingheng]

24:12.480 --> 24:14.880
This is my son Jingheng's memorial tablet.

24:15.440 --> 24:16.370
All these years,

24:17.000 --> 24:18.680
I've never placed a single offering

24:18.680 --> 24:19.200
because

24:20.160 --> 24:22.820
I've been waiting for your head
as the offering!

24:33.750 --> 24:34.720
It seems you're planning

24:34.720 --> 24:36.270
to die together with me.

24:37.240 --> 24:39.500
Unfortunately, I won't let that happen.

25:20.970 --> 25:22.370
The one who will die today

25:22.800 --> 25:23.910
will only be you.

25:34.920 --> 25:36.570
I'm not afraid of death.

25:38.000 --> 25:39.110
Once the door is sealed,

25:39.110 --> 25:40.320
no one gets out.

25:42.000 --> 25:42.960
As long as you, Feng Suige,

25:42.960 --> 25:43.960
die here,

25:44.590 --> 25:46.160
I can die without regret.

25:48.640 --> 25:49.840
Every secret chamber

25:49.960 --> 25:50.820
has an air vent.

25:51.440 --> 25:53.240
We'll definitely find a way out.

26:00.370 --> 26:01.160
I was once trapped

26:01.160 --> 26:02.790
in a dark cell
in the death camp for months.

26:02.790 --> 26:04.590
My sense for enclosed spaces
is far sharper

26:04.590 --> 26:05.240
than most.

26:52.880 --> 26:53.440
Found it.

26:54.300 --> 26:56.160
Though this sealed door is heavy,

26:56.160 --> 26:56.960
if we use explosives

26:56.960 --> 26:58.160
to blow up these bricks

26:58.160 --> 26:59.110
with ventilation holes,

26:59.110 --> 26:59.960
we can get out.

27:01.000 --> 27:01.750
You went to such great lengths

27:01.750 --> 27:03.270
to kill Feng Suige,

27:03.590 --> 27:04.450
only to end up

27:04.640 --> 27:06.370
shooting yourself in the foot.

27:24.070 --> 27:24.590
Move!

27:29.590 --> 27:33.190
[Zhuang Residence]

27:58.960 --> 27:59.820
Your Highness.

28:05.440 --> 28:06.370
You're wounded.

28:06.510 --> 28:08.160
Just a flesh wound. No big deal.

28:08.160 --> 28:09.510
How's the situation on your side?

28:09.510 --> 28:11.050
Some of the assassins were killed,
some fled,

28:11.050 --> 28:12.280
but we caught one alive.

28:12.280 --> 28:13.000
Yun Fang is going after

28:13.000 --> 28:13.740
those who fled.

28:13.740 --> 28:14.640
What about the casualties

28:14.640 --> 28:16.230
among civilians and soldiers?

28:16.230 --> 28:17.090
Five civilians died.

28:17.090 --> 28:18.290
Over 20 were injured.

28:18.310 --> 28:19.390
We lost eight of our men.

28:19.390 --> 28:20.640
A dozen or so were wounded.

28:20.640 --> 28:21.070
Those injured

28:21.070 --> 28:22.870
have all been sent to the clinic.

28:25.200 --> 28:26.630
To kill me,

28:26.720 --> 28:28.750
you didn't hesitate
to harm innocent people.

28:28.750 --> 28:30.680
So many people died because of you!

28:31.030 --> 28:33.360
I only regret my bad luck.

28:34.270 --> 28:35.870
I sacrificed all those lives

28:36.110 --> 28:37.710
and still couldn't kill you.

28:39.070 --> 28:41.600
You really deserve worse than death.

28:41.960 --> 28:43.160
How are the injured?

28:43.400 --> 28:44.570
Is anyone in critical condition?

28:44.570 --> 28:46.300
Several are severely wounded.

28:47.330 --> 28:48.480
Yesterday, Lord Ling said

28:48.480 --> 28:49.650
he was returning to Zhengnian Hall.

28:49.650 --> 28:50.750
Bring the wounded there.

28:50.750 --> 28:52.480
I'll ask him to help treat them.

29:06.160 --> 29:07.160
You want to die?

29:07.550 --> 29:08.680
That's not up to you.

29:09.030 --> 29:10.720
Whether you live or die

29:10.720 --> 29:11.780
is for me to decide.

29:22.680 --> 29:24.680
He's not able to bite his tongue now.

29:26.110 --> 29:27.510
I'm taking Zhuang Shen into the palace now

29:27.510 --> 29:29.320
to clear my mother's name

29:29.400 --> 29:30.320
and avenge her.

29:30.640 --> 29:31.240
Go ahead.

29:31.720 --> 29:33.320
Leave everything else to me.

29:42.160 --> 29:42.820
Guards!

29:43.200 --> 29:44.580
Let me out!

29:44.750 --> 29:46.320
Let me out!

29:46.680 --> 29:48.110
Let me out!

29:48.550 --> 29:50.240
Guards!

29:50.590 --> 29:51.490
Let me out!

29:51.590 --> 29:53.000
Let me out!

29:53.740 --> 29:55.130
Guards!

29:55.400 --> 29:56.350
Let me out!

29:56.500 --> 29:58.070
Let me out!

29:58.270 --> 29:59.400
Is anyone there?

29:59.750 --> 30:01.680
What right do you have to lock me up?

30:01.830 --> 30:03.550
Let me out!

30:04.880 --> 30:05.880
Let me…

30:34.440 --> 30:35.400
Why are you here?

30:37.830 --> 30:38.960
When did you get in?

30:42.790 --> 30:43.760
What do you want?

30:43.960 --> 30:44.880
Let me out now.

30:47.070 --> 30:48.270
I have never seen

30:48.680 --> 30:50.400
a woman as stupid as you.

30:51.400 --> 30:52.590
I had you brought here

30:52.590 --> 30:53.310
just to see

30:53.310 --> 30:54.710
Xia Jingshi's reaction.

30:56.680 --> 30:57.510
But sadly,

30:58.030 --> 30:58.680
he doesn't

30:59.110 --> 31:00.480
care about you at all.

31:01.840 --> 31:03.030
Whether His Highness cares about me

31:03.030 --> 31:04.430
is none of your business!

31:05.350 --> 31:06.680
He's abandoned you,

31:06.920 --> 31:07.960
yet you still keep calling him

31:07.960 --> 31:08.890
"His Highness."

31:09.590 --> 31:10.320
Feng Xiyang,

31:11.120 --> 31:12.000
don't you find yourself

31:12.000 --> 31:12.830
pathetic?

31:15.590 --> 31:16.450
You're crying?

31:17.480 --> 31:18.590
There's no one here.

31:18.590 --> 31:19.920
You can cry all you want.

31:21.070 --> 31:22.200
The louder you cry,

31:23.240 --> 31:24.350
the better I feel.

31:27.960 --> 31:28.820
You're insane.

31:29.920 --> 31:31.070
You may disrespect

31:31.070 --> 31:31.800
Xia Jingshi,

31:33.070 --> 31:34.070
but don't forget,

31:34.440 --> 31:36.240
I am still the Princess of Susha!

31:44.240 --> 31:45.840
Take a good look at yourself!

31:46.510 --> 31:47.030
Do you look

31:47.030 --> 31:49.030
anything like a Susha princess now?

31:51.830 --> 31:53.160
To Xia Jingshi,

31:53.720 --> 31:55.180
you're nothing but a joke.

31:55.550 --> 31:56.030
No,

31:56.920 --> 31:58.520
you're not even worth a joke.

31:58.590 --> 31:59.830
He has never

31:59.830 --> 32:01.160
looked at you properly.

32:02.050 --> 32:02.960
Enough!

32:03.480 --> 32:04.440
Stop talking!

32:06.680 --> 32:08.070
As soon as you left Susha,

32:08.070 --> 32:08.680
your father was

32:08.680 --> 32:10.480
so frustrated that he collapsed.

32:10.480 --> 32:12.250
Your stupidity caused that.

32:13.310 --> 32:15.110
Feng Pingcheng is a great ruler.

32:15.160 --> 32:16.200
How could he have

32:16.200 --> 32:17.860
an idiotic daughter like you?

32:18.110 --> 32:19.310
Feng Suige is the Killer God of Susha.

32:19.310 --> 32:20.200
How could he have

32:20.200 --> 32:21.660
a useless sister like you?

32:21.920 --> 32:22.920
You're a disgrace

32:23.480 --> 32:24.920
to the Feng family.

32:32.720 --> 32:33.720
You're right.

32:34.720 --> 32:35.750
The Feng family shouldn't have

32:35.750 --> 32:37.880
such a weak and incompetent daughter.

32:55.440 --> 32:56.170
How dare you…

33:09.920 --> 33:10.720
Interesting.

33:12.640 --> 33:13.640
In my entire life,

33:14.590 --> 33:16.190
no one has ever hit me before.

33:17.200 --> 33:18.460
This is the first time.

33:19.920 --> 33:21.210
You lunatic!

33:22.590 --> 33:23.500
Let go of me!

33:23.640 --> 33:24.700
What are you doing?

33:24.750 --> 33:26.150
Xia Jingshi ignores you,

33:26.310 --> 33:26.880
uses you,

33:27.350 --> 33:28.240
and tramples on you.

33:28.240 --> 33:29.100
Do you hate him?

33:31.200 --> 33:31.930
Tell me!

33:32.150 --> 33:33.180
Do you hate him?

33:33.350 --> 33:34.080
Feng Xiyang,

33:34.270 --> 33:35.400
do you want him dead?

33:35.680 --> 33:36.810
Do you want him dead?

33:37.750 --> 33:39.010
Do you want to kill him?

33:39.110 --> 33:40.040
Tell me, do you?

33:40.070 --> 33:40.720
I'm asking you.

33:40.720 --> 33:41.590
Answer me!

33:41.640 --> 33:42.830
Do you want him dead?

33:43.790 --> 33:44.590
Yes!

33:45.480 --> 33:46.480
I hate him.

33:47.000 --> 33:48.740
I wish he'd drop dead right now!

33:48.880 --> 33:49.350
Great!

33:51.680 --> 33:53.410
I hate him even more than you do.

33:54.790 --> 33:55.640
Let's…

33:56.240 --> 33:57.110
let's kill him together,

33:57.110 --> 33:57.640
shall we?

34:05.090 --> 34:07.270
[Zhengnian Hall]

34:06.240 --> 34:07.590
Hurry, make way!

34:09.190 --> 34:10.370
Clean their wounds

34:10.400 --> 34:11.330
and wrap them up.

34:13.800 --> 34:14.530
Give it to me.

34:18.230 --> 34:18.840
Press here.

34:18.840 --> 34:19.920
Stop the bleeding. Talk to him.

34:19.920 --> 34:21.380
Don't let him fall asleep.

34:21.710 --> 34:22.570
Sit down first.

34:23.000 --> 34:23.389
Here,

34:23.480 --> 34:23.840
the medicines.

34:23.840 --> 34:24.510
Okay.

34:27.190 --> 34:27.880
Lord Ling.

34:28.230 --> 34:29.190
How is he? Is he alright?

34:29.190 --> 34:29.820
He won't die.

34:29.820 --> 34:30.420
Come.

34:33.030 --> 34:34.230
Everyone, stay calm.

34:34.810 --> 34:35.739
Nice and steady.

34:37.630 --> 34:38.480
Miss Yixiao,

34:38.840 --> 34:40.239
the physicians are here.

34:41.320 --> 34:42.449
Good. That's great.

34:43.670 --> 34:45.010
I was afraid you couldn't handle it alone,

34:45.010 --> 34:46.050
so I got several physicians here

34:46.050 --> 34:47.090
to help you out.

34:47.719 --> 34:48.750
Thank you, guys.

34:49.000 --> 34:49.670
Prepare anesthetics

34:49.670 --> 34:50.300
and morus strings.

34:50.300 --> 34:51.880
Stitch up those with severe injuries.

34:51.880 --> 34:52.480
Alright.

34:52.480 --> 34:53.000
Thank you.

34:53.000 --> 34:53.659
Take this.

34:54.880 --> 34:56.060
You've fought on the battlefield.

34:56.060 --> 34:56.960
Can you bandage wounds?

34:56.960 --> 34:57.230
Yes.

34:57.400 --> 34:58.130
Come with me.

35:11.030 --> 35:11.830
Hang in there.

35:13.670 --> 35:14.150
Let me.

35:14.840 --> 35:16.170
Prime Minister Zhuang?

35:16.640 --> 35:18.170
That's the Prime Minister.

35:18.200 --> 35:19.810
That's the Prime Minister!

35:20.230 --> 35:21.670
What crime has he committed

35:21.670 --> 35:24.130
to be dragged through
the streets like this?

35:30.400 --> 35:32.070
Distribute the medicine to everyone.

35:32.070 --> 35:32.920
Drink this.

35:33.110 --> 35:34.240
You'll feel better.

35:34.330 --> 35:36.440
[Changchun Palace]

35:42.280 --> 35:43.080
Your Majesty,

35:43.400 --> 35:45.040
since His Majesty won't see you,

35:45.040 --> 35:46.850
why put yourself through this?

35:47.230 --> 35:47.960
You're too fragile

35:47.960 --> 35:49.690
to endure kneeling for so long.

35:50.230 --> 35:51.560
Please go back and rest.

35:56.590 --> 35:57.160
Mother!

36:01.030 --> 36:01.910
What happened?

36:02.320 --> 36:03.250
Why are you here?

36:04.110 --> 36:04.920
Eunuch Ma,

36:05.150 --> 36:06.420
didn't I tell you

36:06.550 --> 36:08.010
not to disturb Chengyang?

36:08.590 --> 36:09.050
This...

36:09.280 --> 36:09.740
Mother,

36:09.880 --> 36:10.680
please get up.

36:10.920 --> 36:12.190
The floor is hard and cold.

36:12.190 --> 36:13.230
Your knees will be damaged.

36:13.230 --> 36:14.020
Be good.

36:14.440 --> 36:15.280
Go back now.

36:16.480 --> 36:17.060
Mother.

36:17.670 --> 36:19.470
Did you argue with Father again?

36:19.960 --> 36:21.190
Let me plead for you.

36:22.710 --> 36:24.240
Don't get involved in this.

36:24.400 --> 36:25.400
Stay out of it.

36:25.750 --> 36:27.090
Go back right now.

36:30.530 --> 36:31.930
No matter what happened,

36:32.840 --> 36:34.620
even if you've made countless mistakes,

36:34.620 --> 36:36.150
I'll take the blame for you.

36:36.760 --> 36:38.030
I'll kneel here for you.

36:38.030 --> 36:39.430
Mother, go back and rest.

36:39.710 --> 36:40.400
Chengyang,

36:40.840 --> 36:41.760
be good.

36:41.960 --> 36:43.710
I've never disobeyed you before.

36:43.710 --> 36:45.570
Just let me disobey you this once.

36:47.940 --> 36:50.530
[Grace in Blessed Accord]

36:51.880 --> 36:52.630
Eunuch Ma,

36:52.630 --> 36:53.590
the First Prince

36:53.590 --> 36:55.070
has arrested Zhuang…

36:57.970 --> 37:00.750
[Changchun Palace]

37:05.880 --> 37:06.680
Your Majesty,

37:06.800 --> 37:08.710
the First Prince has entered the palace.

37:08.710 --> 37:10.280
He's arrested Prime Minister Zhuang

37:10.280 --> 37:12.280
and is heading to Changchun Palace.

37:12.630 --> 37:14.030
He arrested Zhuang Shen?

37:14.230 --> 37:14.590
Yes.

37:16.670 --> 37:19.880
The elite troops of the Feng Battalion
assembled last night.

37:19.880 --> 37:21.290
Has he

37:21.590 --> 37:23.960
led the Feng Battalion into the city?

37:24.030 --> 37:24.790
No.

37:25.030 --> 37:26.190
This morning, His Highness

37:26.190 --> 37:27.070
went to the Zhuang Residence

37:27.070 --> 37:28.230
with only a few dozen men.

37:28.230 --> 37:30.000
He was ambushed on Yongning Street.

37:30.000 --> 37:30.710
The head of the assassins was

37:30.710 --> 37:32.670
Zhuang Ming, the Prime Minister's nephew.

37:32.670 --> 37:34.000
Zhuang Ming is now dead.

37:34.000 --> 37:35.620
His Highness came alone

37:35.920 --> 37:37.230
with Prime Minister Zhuang.

37:37.230 --> 37:37.800
Suige…

37:41.360 --> 37:43.720
Is the First Prince injured?

37:43.760 --> 37:44.980
He seems mostly fine,

37:45.670 --> 37:47.300
but Prime Minister Zhuang is injured.

37:47.300 --> 37:48.620
He doesn't look good.

37:49.670 --> 37:50.470
Your Majesty,

37:50.550 --> 37:52.400
Her Majesty and the Second Prince

37:52.400 --> 37:53.660
are kneeling outside.

37:54.320 --> 37:56.260
Do you want them to leave?

37:57.440 --> 37:58.700
Make Chengyang leave.

38:00.150 --> 38:01.480
What about Her Majesty?

38:04.360 --> 38:05.630
This is her fate.

38:07.590 --> 38:08.840
She cannot avoid it.

38:10.510 --> 38:11.000
Yes.

38:15.000 --> 38:16.150
This day

38:17.030 --> 38:18.960
has finally come.

38:22.970 --> 38:25.400
[Grace in Blessed Accord]

38:25.610 --> 38:26.570
Second Prince.

38:28.190 --> 38:28.760
Let me go!

38:29.550 --> 38:31.130
Forgive me, Your Highness.

38:31.280 --> 38:32.770
Please leave.

38:33.070 --> 38:34.480
This is His Majesty's order.

38:34.480 --> 38:35.400
With my mother here like this,

38:35.400 --> 38:36.710
how could I possibly leave?

38:36.710 --> 38:37.780
If Father is angry,

38:38.000 --> 38:39.530
I'm willing to be punished.

38:40.030 --> 38:41.480
Escort His Highness back.

38:41.480 --> 38:42.140
-Yes.
-Yes.

38:43.360 --> 38:44.620
-Chengyang.
-Mother!

38:45.480 --> 38:46.110
Father!

38:46.110 --> 38:46.840
Eunuch Ma,

38:47.230 --> 38:48.760
what is the meaning of this?

38:48.960 --> 38:49.760
Your Majesty,

38:49.880 --> 38:50.920
His Majesty ordered this

38:50.920 --> 38:52.580
to protect the Second Prince.

38:54.150 --> 38:55.000
Tell me,

38:56.590 --> 38:58.170
has something happened?

38:58.360 --> 38:59.840
You'll know soon enough.

39:08.440 --> 39:09.200
My Lords,

39:09.280 --> 39:11.110
when the First Prince
entered the palace earlier,

39:11.110 --> 39:12.670
he instructed me
to wait here with a message.

39:12.670 --> 39:13.580
You shall all

39:13.670 --> 39:14.800
go to the Changchun Palace.

39:14.800 --> 39:15.800
Please follow me.

39:18.840 --> 39:19.440
Hurry!

39:52.980 --> 39:56.270
[Changchun Palace]

40:00.890 --> 40:01.450
Stop her!

40:01.920 --> 40:02.480
Father!

40:02.800 --> 40:03.470
Father!

40:03.630 --> 40:04.510
Let go of me!

40:04.800 --> 40:05.630
Let go of me!

40:06.510 --> 40:07.110
Father,

40:07.440 --> 40:08.560
what happened?

40:08.960 --> 40:09.760
Father!

40:10.150 --> 40:11.190
Let me go!

40:12.190 --> 40:12.840
Let…

40:14.280 --> 40:15.150
Father!

40:17.320 --> 40:18.400
Father!

40:19.800 --> 40:21.440
I want to see my mother!

40:21.880 --> 40:23.280
Mother!

40:23.550 --> 40:24.800
Let go of me!

40:25.070 --> 40:27.030
I want to see my mother!

40:27.510 --> 40:28.880
Let go of me!

40:28.880 --> 40:30.590
I want to see my mother!

40:31.510 --> 40:32.780
Let go of me!

40:32.920 --> 40:34.070
Let go of me!

40:34.550 --> 40:36.330
I want to see my mother!

40:36.510 --> 40:38.030
Mother!

40:38.670 --> 40:40.070
Let go of me!

40:40.400 --> 40:42.190
I want to see my mother!

40:42.800 --> 40:44.380
Let go of me!

40:44.880 --> 40:45.920
Mother!

40:46.320 --> 40:48.320
I want to see my mother!

40:49.000 --> 40:50.650
Let go of me!

40:50.960 --> 40:52.920
I want to see my mother!

40:53.920 --> 40:55.630
Mother!

40:55.920 --> 40:57.590
Let go of me!

40:58.510 --> 41:00.320
Mother!

41:00.340 --> 41:01.420
Let go of me!

41:02.030 --> 41:02.790
Father!

41:04.150 --> 41:05.000
Let go…

41:05.480 --> 41:06.660
Let go of me.

41:06.980 --> 41:07.890
Father.

41:08.630 --> 41:09.280
Father.

41:09.710 --> 41:10.400
Father,

41:10.520 --> 41:11.860
what exactly happened?

41:11.960 --> 41:12.590
Father!

41:13.390 --> 41:14.360
Let me go!

41:16.710 --> 41:17.770
Father!

41:17.040 --> 41:19.230
[Grace in Blessed Accord]

41:20.590 --> 41:21.490
Feng Suige,

41:21.550 --> 41:22.880
what are you going to do?

41:23.030 --> 41:24.190
This is the imperial palace.

41:24.190 --> 41:26.070
How dare you attack the Prime Minister?

41:26.070 --> 41:27.670
Are you staging a rebellion?

41:28.090 --> 41:29.820
It was at this place that you

41:29.880 --> 41:31.410
killed my mother back then.

41:32.360 --> 41:34.660
Today, I'll make you pay for it

41:35.210 --> 41:36.630
with your life here.

41:41.770 --> 41:42.530
Let go!

41:50.770 --> 41:51.640
Your Majesty.

41:53.030 --> 41:53.830
Your Majesty.

41:56.110 --> 41:56.910
Your Majesty,

41:57.000 --> 41:58.190
I beg for your mercy.

41:59.000 --> 42:00.440
Please save my father.

42:02.070 --> 42:03.840
No matter how grave his crimes,

42:04.480 --> 42:06.150
he is still my father

42:06.630 --> 42:08.360
and Chengyang's grandfather.

42:08.880 --> 42:10.360
I would rather die myself

42:10.360 --> 42:12.150
than watch my father die.

42:12.670 --> 42:13.470
Your Majesty,

42:14.670 --> 42:15.840
for the sake of the years

42:15.840 --> 42:17.960
we spent as husband and wife,

42:18.190 --> 42:19.630
please save him.

42:21.190 --> 42:21.990
Your Majesty,

42:22.400 --> 42:23.710
only you can

42:23.710 --> 42:24.960
stop Feng Suige now.

42:34.240 --> 42:35.970
Your Majesty, have you agreed?

42:36.960 --> 42:37.670
Empress.

42:41.880 --> 42:44.190
My condolences.

42:56.110 --> 42:57.150
What did you say?

42:59.320 --> 43:00.630
Don't you remember?

43:01.670 --> 43:04.590
15 years ago, right here,

43:05.630 --> 43:07.510
I watched helplessly

43:07.530 --> 43:08.900
as Qingyu died.

43:09.710 --> 43:10.840
The first thing

43:10.840 --> 43:12.570
you said to me was

43:13.320 --> 43:14.380
"My condolences."

43:27.840 --> 43:28.640
Your Majesty,

43:29.670 --> 43:30.600
my condolences.

43:35.920 --> 43:38.480
You're the Empress of Susha.

43:39.400 --> 43:40.760
How can you cry?

43:42.230 --> 43:44.190
Your father schemed meticulously

43:44.190 --> 43:45.320
to kill Qingyu

43:45.360 --> 43:48.070
just so you could become empress.

43:49.630 --> 43:51.800
He's about to die now.

43:53.400 --> 43:55.000
This is the last time

43:55.000 --> 43:56.670
he'll ever see his daughter.

43:57.550 --> 43:59.150
He should see

43:59.550 --> 44:01.440
the dignified,

44:02.000 --> 44:04.030
composed,

44:04.590 --> 44:07.150
majestic empress of the kingdom.

44:10.880 --> 44:11.510
Don't cry.

44:13.960 --> 44:15.510
Smile.

44:29.960 --> 44:31.150
Zhuang Shen.

44:33.960 --> 44:36.400
You should die here.

44:37.440 --> 44:38.880
You should die here!
